{"4279630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Friendly Steps", "steam_appid": 4279630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/38777e439cc829d3b560ba4957f27320.poster.avif?t=1788332269\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/38777e439cc829d3b560ba4957f27320.webm?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/38777e439cc829d3b560ba4957f27320.mp4?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRUNK-WALKING PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay now, get yourself together and control your legs, one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy? Not really. You literally have to control each leg independently. Keep your balance, stumble forward, crawl if you must. Just try not to land face-first on the pavement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/71e5b510b4845e0aa5b0e0f06e6f0689.poster.avif?t=1788332269\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/71e5b510b4845e0aa5b0e0f06e6f0689.webm?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/71e5b510b4845e0aa5b0e0f06e6f0689.mp4?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRINK AS A TEAM, GET HOME AS A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rope sounded like a fun idea: chained together, like conquering a peak, right? It would be a shame if you fell off the bridge with this rope on and dragged the whole squad down with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/ed873169712040a09d295adb820a01e7.poster.avif?t=1788332269\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/ed873169712040a09d295adb820a01e7.webm?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/ed873169712040a09d295adb820a01e7.mp4?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY IS THIS CITY SO HARD ON US?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I suggested calling an Uber, but you guys wanted to take a walk and take some side quests, huh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you're dealing with hills, stairs, bridges, parks, construction sites, playgrounds, and all kinds of sketchy “shortcuts” and suspicious bozos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every street corner turns into a new physics challenge waiting to ruin your walk home. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/fa646ee17812981986266dfc69297e38.poster.avif?t=1788332269\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/fa646ee17812981986266dfc69297e38.webm?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/fa646ee17812981986266dfc69297e38.mp4?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WASTED AND FABULOUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look and stumble through the night in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salaryman, firefighter, punk, cop, or maybe a streamer? Pick your ridiculous look and hit the streets. Everyone deserves a little fun after hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Physics-based movement: control each leg independently<br>• Rope-linked co-op chaos (1-4 players)<br>• Various locations and challenging routes<br>• Hidden shortcuts, items, quests, and side paths<br>• Speedrun mode -  find the fastest way home<br>• Character customization and emotes<br>• Online voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/d7b03a68dd65a05fdff33dea90322f8c.poster.avif?t=1788332269\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/d7b03a68dd65a05fdff33dea90322f8c.webm?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/d7b03a68dd65a05fdff33dea90322f8c.mp4?t=1788332269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Burp*</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe that last drink was a bad idea!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279630/extras/38777e439cc829d3b560ba4957f27320.poster.avif?t=1788332269\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st